 "text": "Planning a trip can feel like a lot of work. I break it into four small steps. First, I choose the dates and set a budget. Next, I look for a place to stay near public transport. Third, I make a short list of things I really want to see. I keep that list short, because a full plan leaves no room for surprises. Finally, I pack light. One small bag is enough for almost any trip. On the first day, I simply walk around and get a feel for the place. The best moments of a trip are often the ones you did not plan."
